=== ht-1: MAX(BIGINT) > a neighbour above 2^53 ===
== Query ==
SELECT g, MAX(b) AS mx FROM hv_n GROUP BY g
HAVING MAX(b) > 1234567890123456788;

Number of output lines, including header: 3

== Diff ==
==========



== Expected result ==
SELECT g, MAX(b) AS mx FROM hv_n GROUP BY g
HAVING MAX(b) > 1234567890123456788|
g	mx
2	9223372036854775807
3	1234567890123456789

